  "sourceTitle": "Orange Grapefruit Spritzer",
  "sourceText": "Orange Grapefruit Spritzer\nBy: Amie Valpone\nPublished: Monday, September 26, 2011 - 11:54am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\nJuice from 2 large oranges\nJuice from 1 large grapefruit\n1 tsp. agave nectar\n1/4 cup seltzer\n1 lemon, sliced\n1 lime, sliced\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients in pitcher; mix well to combine.  Set aside in the sunshine for 1 hour. 2 Transfer into two serving glasses.  Serve atop ice cubes.",
